{"title": "Ring of Regeneration", "pageid": 9555, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Ring_of_Regeneration", "categories": ["Rings", "Very rare items", "Sources of healing", "Self-Heal set"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-veryrare\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ring_of_Regeneration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a5/Ring_of_Regeneration_Icon.png/300px-Ring_of_Regeneration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/a/a5/Ring_of_Regeneration_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Ring of Regeneration image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a5/Ring_of_Regeneration_Icon.png/300px-Ring_of_Regeneration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a5/Ring_of_Regeneration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #D1017B ;\">Ring of Regeneration</span></a> is a very rare <a href=\"/wiki/Rings\" title=\"Rings\">Ring</a> that heals the wearer at the beginning of their turn while in combat.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>This ring is, in effect, a tiny field medic that won't charge you 70 gold pieces for a fifteen-minute consultation.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rings\" title=\"Rings\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Rings_Icon.png/25px-Rings_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Rings_Icon.png/38px-Rings_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Rings_Icon.png/50px-Rings_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rings\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Rings_Icon.png/25px-Rings_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c4/Rings_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Rings\" title=\"Rings\">Rings</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Very rare\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #D1017B ;\">Very rare</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.05 kg (0.1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.05 kg (0.1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 360 gp / 580 gpHHonour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  360  gp /  580  gp<abbr title=\"Honour mode only\" class=\"bg3wiki-damage-rider-source nomobile\">H</abbr><sup class=\"mobileonly\">Honour</sup></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_PHB_OfRegeneration_Ring</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_PHB_OfRegeneration_Ring\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_PHB_OfRegeneration_Ring\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">d6ee2594-7373-4fed-a167-f9d95cb4ecfd</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:d6ee2594-7373-4fed-a167-f9d95cb4ecfd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:d6ee2594-7373-4fed-a167-f9d95cb4ecfd\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_PHB_OfRegeneration_Ring</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_PHB_OfRegeneration_Ring+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_PHB_OfRegeneration_Ring+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Combat_Regeneration\" title=\"Combat Regeneration\">Combat Regeneration</a></dt><dd>At the beginning of your turn, the ring activates and heals you <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/25px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/38px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/50px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"hit points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/25px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">hit points</span></a>.</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Act_Three\" title=\"Act Three\">Act Three</a>:\n<ul><li>If <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rolan\" title=\"Rolan\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Rolan.png/25px-Portrait_Rolan.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Rolan.png/38px-Portrait_Rolan.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Rolan.png/50px-Portrait_Rolan.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rolan\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Rolan.png/25px-Portrait_Rolan.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7b/Portrait_Rolan.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Rolan\" title=\"Rolan\">Rolan</a> is dead: Sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lorroakan%27s_Projection\" title=\"Lorroakan's Projection\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Portrait_Lorroakan%27s_Projection.png/25px-Portrait_Lorroakan%27s_Projection.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Portrait_Lorroakan%27s_Projection.png/38px-Portrait_Lorroakan%27s_Projection.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Portrait_Lorroakan%27s_Projection.png/50px-Portrait_Lorroakan%27s_Projection.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lorroakan's Projection\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Portrait_Lorroakan%27s_Projection.png/25px-Portrait_Lorroakan%27s_Projection.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/74/Portrait_Lorroakan%27s_Projection.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lorroakan%27s_Projection\" title=\"Lorroakan's Projection\">Lorroakan's Projection</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Sorcerous_Sundries\" title=\"Sorcerous Sundries\">Sorcerous Sundries</a></li>\n<li>If <a href=\"/wiki/Rolan\" title=\"Rolan\">Rolan</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Lorroakan\" title=\"Lorroakan\">Lorroakan</a> are both alive: Sold by <a href=\"/wiki/Rolan\" title=\"Rolan\">Rolan</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Sorcerous_Sundries\" title=\"Sorcerous Sundries\">Sorcerous Sundries</a></li>\n<li>If <a href=\"/wiki/Rolan\" title=\"Rolan\">Rolan</a> is alive but <a href=\"/wiki/Lorroakan\" title=\"Lorroakan\">Lorroakan</a> is dead: Carried by <a href=\"/wiki/Rolan\" title=\"Rolan\">Rolan</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Ramazith%27s_Tower\" title=\"Ramazith's Tower\">Ramazith's Tower</a> shortly after Lorroakan is killed (may disappear from Rolan's inventory later)</li>\n<li>If both <a href=\"/wiki/Rolan\" title=\"Rolan\">Rolan</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Lorroakan\" title=\"Lorroakan\">Lorroakan</a> are dead or missing: Ring is unavailable</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n\n<p><i>Regarding Combat Regeneration:</i></p>\n<ul><li>The healing effect from Combat Regeneration activates only while in combat.</li>\n<li>The healing effect still triggers even if the wearer has full hit points.</li>\n<li>The healing effect does not seem to work when downed.</li></ul>\n<p>Pairs well with:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blessed_Healer\" title=\"Blessed Healer\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Generic_Healing_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Healing_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Generic_Healing_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Healing_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Generic_Healing_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Healing_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blessed Healer\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Generic_Healing_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Healing_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3f/Generic_Healing_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blessed_Healer\" title=\"Blessed Healer\">Blessed Healer</a> for an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">3</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/25px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/38px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/50px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"hit points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/25px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">hit points</span></a></li>\n<li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Boots_of_Aid_and_Comfort\" title=\"Boots of Aid and Comfort\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Boots_of_Aid_and_Comfort_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Boots_of_Aid_and_Comfort_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Boots_of_Aid_and_Comfort_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Boots_of_Aid_and_Comfort_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Boots_of_Aid_and_Comfort_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Boots_of_Aid_and_Comfort_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Boots_of_Aid_and_Comfort_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Boots_of_Aid_and_Comfort_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/30/Boots_of_Aid_and_Comfort_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Boots_of_Aid_and_Comfort\" title=\"Boots of Aid and Comfort\">Boots of Aid and Comfort</a> for an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/38px-HP_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"3 temporary hit points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link fo